WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.025
Why script it?

2
00:00:01.025 --> 00:00:04.413
Your ISSO asks the same
questions every month.

3
00:00:04.413 --> 00:00:05.662
Who hasn't signed in?

4
00:00:05.662 --> 00:00:08.149
What do the Conditional
Access policies say?

5
00:00:08.149 --> 00:00:10.313
Who holds a privileged role permanently?

6
00:00:10.313 --> 00:00:12.537
Which applications still have passwords?

7
00:00:12.537 --> 00:00:16.399
And who can't yet use phishing-resistant
multifactor authentication?

8
00:00:16.399 --> 00:00:20.247
Too often, someone answers by
clicking through the admin center and

9
00:00:20.247 --> 00:00:24.025
pasting screenshots, and the answer
can't be reproduced next month.

10
00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:28.359
In this module each question becomes
a Graph call with a least-privileged

11
00:00:28.359 --> 00:00:32.978
permission, and five of them become
read-only checks you can rerun on a schedule,

12
00:00:32.978 --> 00:00:36.460
with output an assessor can diff
from one month to the next.
